  "body": "I have installed Matrix server and all are working fine, Then I tried to integrate matrix to ldap after giving ldap configuration the matrix server went down, it no more listen to the ports 8448 and 8008. Server didn't give any error message while restarting the service. Please help to solve this issue. I didn't make any changes in other configuration files.\r\n=====\r\nldap_config:\r\n   enabled: true\r\n   server: \"ldap://localhost\"\r\n   port: 389\r\n   tls: false\r\n   search_base: \"ou=Users,dc=example,dc=com\"\r\n   search_property: \"cn\"\r\n   email_property: \"email\"\r\n   full_name_property: \"givenName\"\r\n===",
